			Typography:
				Align: right
	Section:
		Text: Document and sections
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Id, Style and Trim margins of a section
		Paragraph: The `Id` of a section is its first page, for a link or a reference. Its `Style` gives it typography only: the appendix on page 2 is serif and in Catalan. `Trim margins` drops the margin of its first or last child, so the content starts at the top of the page area.
			Style: intro
		Text: Link: #appendix  (a whole box that leads to page {page of: appendix})
			Style: card
			Link: #appendix
	Section:
		Id: appendix
		Style: appendix
		Text: Id: appendix, Style: appendix  (Typography: Font: IBM Plex Serif, Language: ca)
			Style: card
		Paragraph: Aquest annex és en català, amb la lletra de la regla de l'estil.
	Section:
		Trim margins: top
		Block:
			Style: card spaced
			Text: Trim margins: top
			Text: This block has Margin: 40 at the top, and the section drops it.
	Section:
		Block:
			Style: card spaced
			Text: Trim margins: none  (the default)
			Text: The same block, with its top margin of 40.
